<title>UK: Sigma Finance sets 125 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Sigma Finance sets 125 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGMA FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    29.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.15    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
